ShortDescription: Terminal-first Markdown viewer with diagrams, live reload and a browser mode
Description: |-
  readmd renders Markdown right in your terminal: headings, tables, GitHub alerts, task lists,
  syntax-highlighted code, math, and mermaid / D2 / Graphviz / PlantUML diagrams as inline images
  (Sixel, kitty or iTerm2 graphics). It live-reloads as you edit, searches across a whole folder of
  documents, follows wiki links with history, and can export to HTML or PDF or open the same document
  in your browser.
